{
  "_help": [
    "The Deck app's Dev tools page is made from this list. Edit it (Dev tools > Edit this list), then press Reload.",
    "groups: each has a name and items. An item can have:",
    "  name        what to show",
    "  exe         the program (Open starts it; its version is read from it). %USERPROFILE% etc. work.",
    "  glob        instead of exe: a path with * - one row for every match (e.g. every Unity editor); several separated by ;",
    "  appid       instead of exe: a Microsoft Store app's ID (PowerShell: Get-StartApps | Where-Object Name -like '*name*')",
    "  cli         true = a command-line tool: shows its version, no Open button",
    "  process     the process name that means it's running (default: the exe's name)",
    "  mcp         the name of its MCP server in Claude's settings - shows whether Claude has it",
    "  envkey      Windows user variable(s) that must be set, several separated by ; (shows saved / missing, never the value)",
    "  heartbeat   {file, max_age_s, on, off}: shows 'running' while that file keeps being rewritten",
    "  note        a short line of help",
    "  actions     extra buttons: label + run (+ args). ask_folder: true asks for a folder and adds it to args.",
    "              run can be a program, a script, a folder, a file or a web address."
  ],
